{"title":"Glimmerfox","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 41 Moonbeast that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">freeze</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/moonhart-antler\">Moonhart Antler</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox?lv=41\">Lv 41 <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox?lv=42\">Lv 42 <span>7</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>41</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>203</td><td>27.1</td><td>2,050</td><td class=\"muted\">609 · 37.9 · 6,150</td><td>2</td><td>in the wilds around 1530, 1649</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox?lv=42\" title=\"Pick level 42\"><td><b>42</b></td><td>212</td><td>27.6</td><td>2,100</td><td class=\"muted\">636 · 38.6 · 6,300</td><td>7</td><td>in the wilds around 1625, 1612</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"glimmerfox\" data-map-level=\"41\">Show level 41 on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 1 looted corpse recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"glimmerfox-pelt\" title=\"Glimmerfox Pelt - in 100% of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/03a19913fc54d1b9159e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Glimmerfox Pelt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 1/1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"silver-hide\" title=\"Silver Hide - in 100% of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/33e265dd0c1eb3e33136.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Silver Hide</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 1/1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-909.9px,-2927.4px)\"><img src=\"tiles/4/2/10.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:512px;top:2560px\"><img src=\"tiles/4/2/11.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:512px;top:2816px\"><img src=\"tiles/4/3/10.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:768px;top:2560px\"><img src=\"tiles/4/3/11.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:768px;top:2816px\"><img src=\"tiles/4/4/10.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1024px;top:2560px\"><img src=\"tiles/4/4/11.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1024px;top:2816px\"><i style=\"left:928.5px;t